# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal content - never commit
#
# This kit is meant to be cloned and shared. Everything below is one person's
# career data, active job search, or local machine state. None of it is useful
# to another user of the repo, and most of it identifies you by name, email,
# phone, employer, and the roles you are applying to.
#
# The rule: the repo tracks empty scaffolding plus the kit's own examples.
# Your filled-in copies stay on your machine.
#
# Note: .gitignore only affects UNTRACKED files. Files that are already tracked
# (config.md, the .tex templates, _INVENTORY.md) get personalized in place and
# cannot be protected this way - see "Protecting tracked template files" in
# DOCS.md for the skip-worktree guard used instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Real job postings you are applying to
JDs/*
!JDs/example_jd.txt

# Generated application packages: resumes, cover letters, session files, PDFs.
# These carry your name, email, phone, and full employment history.
output/*
!output/.gitkeep

# Your knowledge base: raw source material and per-project extractions
knowledge_base/extractions/*
!knowledge_base/extractions/_INVENTORY.md
knowledge_base/papers/*
!knowledge_base/papers/.gitkeep
knowledge_base/notes/*
!knowledge_base/notes/.gitkeep

# Your synthesized career files, built by /setup-build-kb
resume_builder/experience/*
!resume_builder/experience/.gitkeep
resume_builder/bundles/*
!resume_builder/bundles/.gitkeep
resume_builder/support/*
!resume_builder/support/.gitkeep
!resume_builder/support/ai_fingerprint_rules.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local Claude Code state - machine-specific, not part of the kit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/HANDOFF.md
.claude/HANDOFF.md.consumed
.claude/hooks/
.claude/logs/
.claude/orchestration/
.claude/rules/
.claude/state/
.instance/

# Skill-development scratch: eval runs, fixtures, graded outputs
.claude/skills/*-workspace/
